-- Deferred Specifications
------------------------------------------------------------

deferred JekyllMigration.ingest    -- see: jekyll-migration.allium

------------------------------------------------------------
-- Open Questions
------------------------------------------------------------

open question "Which current HTML metadata fields and structured data must be preserved exactly?"
-- Answered: the public origin uses Vera's existing application, page renderer
-- and layout system under `anybody`; it is not a visual reinterpretation or a
-- separate site template. See OneVeraWithSmallerAuthority and
-- SameApplicationSameReadingSystem.
